{
  "id": "world-1428",
  "title": "Ukaeb",
  "description": "Palauan ukaeb is associated with crab and rich coconut dressing. This home version bakes seasoned crab in ramekins instead of re-stuffing cleaned crab shells.",
  "regionId": "oceania",
  "countryCode": "PW",
  "servings": 4,
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "step-1",
      "instruction": "Steam cleaned blue crabs until the meat is fully opaque and cooked. Cool enough to handle, then remove all shell and cartilage, keeping about 350 g of crab meat.",
